data errs = time,error rate; 14:00,0.2; 14:05,4.1; 14:10,17.8; 14:15,29.6; 14:20,38.5; 14:25,36.9; 14:30,37.2; 14:35,35.0; 14:40,33.4; 14:45,12.7; 14:50,0.6; 14:55,0.3
chart line errs x=time y=error rate unit=% title="Error rate, 5 minute intervals"

# Root cause

The pool size change went through without a bounds check, so the bad value reached production. The rollback removed it.

! The config linter did not validate pool size bounds.

# Action items

table = Action,Owner,Due; add bounds validation for pool settings,Marta Kowalski,2026-09-24; canary config changes to 5 percent of pods first,Ravi Shah,2026-10-08; alert on pool saturation above 80 percent,Billing on-call,2026-09-17; Write a runbook for connection pool exhaustion,Lena Fischer,2026-10-15
